SUMMARY:Mom Walks
LOCATION:Moncus Park\, 2913 Johnston Street\, Lafayette
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Mom Walks\, a weekly gathering that brings moms tog
 ether to enjoy movement\, conversation\, and fresh air in the heart of Mon
 cus Park\, presented by Lafayette Pediatric Dentistry. This growing commun
 ity of local moms meets regularly to connect\, walk at a comfortable pace\
 , and spend time outdoors together. These walks offer a chance to build re
 lationships\, share experiences\, and feel supported alongside others in s
 imilar seasons of motherhood. Mom Walks are designed to be simple\, welcom
 ing\, and restorative. Come as you are\, walk or linger as you like\, and 
 enjoy time in a space that feels calm and grounding. When: Every Wednesday
  at 9:30 AMWhere: Meet at the Veterans Memorial at Moncus Park Whether you
  are new to motherhood or have been on this journey for a while\, you are 
 invited to join us for connection\, community\, and time outside in the be
 autiful setting of Moncus Park. Completely free to attend and all mothers 
 and maternal figures are welcome to join!\n\nhttps://moncuspark.org/calend
 ar-events/momwalks2026/
URL:https://moncuspark.org/calendar-events/momwalks2026/
